    "modifiedAt": "2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "pst_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -354
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Generative poster\n\nA Swiss-style poster as a system of rules. Layout lays out a grid of modules (and eases them to their new places when the column count changes); each module picks a shape — disc, quarter, half, triangle or nothing — a turn and a colour from noise along the module number (the Rules subpatch), and the shapes not picked are drawn at size zero; the noise follows the patch seed, so Vary re-composes the whole poster. The colours are a harmony of one base colour (the Palette node's harmony modes), the title animates in letter by letter and waves, and the print finish is grain or a halftone.\n\n• Colour picker: the base colour.  • Slider into `cols`: columns (watch the modules move).\n• Toggle: halftone print.  • Vary: a new composition.\n• Presets panel: Bauhaus, Swiss, Night (harmony, colour, columns and seed together; drag Morph between them).",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 290
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Generative poster\n\nA Swiss-style poster as a system of rules. Layout lays out a grid of modules (and eases them to their new places when the column count changes); each module picks a shape — disc, quarter, half, triangle or nothing — a turn and a colour from noise along the module number (the Rules subpatch), and the shapes not picked are drawn at size zero; the noise follows the patch seed, so Vary re-composes the whole poster. The colours are a harmony of one base colour (the Palette node's harmony modes), the title animates in letter by letter and waves, and the print finish is grain or a halftone.\n\n• Colour picker: the base colour.  • Slider into `cols`: columns (watch the modules move).\n• Toggle: halftone print.  • Vary: a new composition.\n• Presets panel: Bauhaus, Swiss, Night (harmony, colour, columns and seed together; drag Morph between them).",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 290
      }
    },
